-- ============================================================================
--  Knowledge-graph seed — namespace 2 (data & labels): the static.label_dim
--  SMALLINT vocabularies describe themselves — one entity per label domain
--  (tags = the domain's code LABELS verbatim, the findability vocabulary),
--  one entity per table a typed column lives in (tags empty: ns2 tables are
--  walk targets, the lexical seeds are the domains), edges labeled_by /
--  for_<column> (head = the typed table). Conventions:
--  .agents/skills/kg-db-semantics. DDL: 13_kg_hypergraph.sql.
--
--  GENERATED — do not hand-edit. Regenerate after any label_dim domain
--  change or typed-table change:
--      python temp_scripts/generate_kg_data_labels.py
--  (usage discovery: column comments referencing label_dim '<domain>' ∪
--  SMALLINT columns NAMED after their domain, validated live, partition
--  children rooted to their parent; domain one-liners harvested from the
--  label_dim seed files' own intro comments), then apply with
--  temp_scripts/apply_kg.py.
--
--  Idempotent — entities upsert on uq_kg_entities_ns_type_name; edges
--  insert only when the (relation, sub_relation, entity_ids) triple is
--  absent. Superseded shapes are regenerated away by re-running the
--  generator + a temp_scripts one-time purge of the retired names.
-- ============================================================================

